  "title": "Nick Cannon delivers a music visual for new song \"Eyes Closed\"",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nick Cannon drops a music visual for new song \"Eyes Closed,\" the visual might just be the artist’s most cinematic and emotional moment yet. It captures the nuances of his performances and matches the power of his voice with a fittingly impactful narrative. It showcases another side of&nbsp;<strong>Nick</strong>&nbsp;and instantly connects in the process. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Watch the&nbsp;<strong>“Eyes Closed”</strong>&nbsp;music video</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cv8WwhL2Nb0\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cv8WwhL2Nb0\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The single \"Eyes Closed\" is the perfect song to let your mind run away to. It’s impressive in every way, and makes a song that not only shows his supreme talent, but a record you can enjoy with no limits.&nbsp;<strong>Nick Cannon’s</strong>&nbsp;artistry is on full bloom for the world to enjoy with one of a kind that anyone can hear and admire.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stream \"Eyes Closed\" by Nick Cannon</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0WHT6ByPNfwLmTuoCy3Pv8\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/0WHT6ByPNfwLmTuoCy3Pv8\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follow Nick Cannon on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nickcannon/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NickCannon/videos/?_rdr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Facebook</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/NickCannon?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Twitter</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/480i0t8YiGc2aoOR6BeLAb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Spotify</a>, and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYnriBqJ6W9NkSM229oi0Ag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">YouTube</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
